@startuml
' Yang Shuo with OpenAI Codex assistance. #641; DG 5.3.
' Trace: CanonicalAddLessonCommand, CanonicalEditLessonCommand,
' TutorResolver, LessonEditCandidate, PonHubData and PonHubDataState.
!include feature-sequence-style.iuml
participant "executor :\nCanonicalCommandExecutor" as E
participant "command :\nStagedCommand" as C
participant "staged :\nPonHubData" as D

E -> C : execute(staged, stagedView)\n[parsed Lesson input]
alt addlesson
  C -> D : Read Tutor candidates
  note over C : TutorResolver matches name and optional exact phone.
  note over C, D : Reject absent, ambiguous or mismatched Tutor.
  C -> D : addLesson(...)
  note over D : Allocate L-ID; validate Tutor/room clashes.
else editlesson
  C -> D : getLesson(id); inspect\nretained attendance
  note over C, D
    Reject incompatible weekday before Tutor lookup.
    Resolve a replacement Tutor only when supplied.
  end note
  C -> D : exportState()
  D --> C : current staged snapshot
  note over C : LessonEditCandidate prepares a replacement.
  opt replacement changed
    C -> D : resetData(candidate state)
  end
  note over D
    Validate combined slot and all other bookings.
    Preserve ID, catalogue position, roster and history.
  end note
end
C --> E : feedback or validation error
opt valid candidate or no-op
  ref over E : Persist and publish — Figure 5.2a
end
note over E, D
  Retained-attendance display warning is prepared
  for a changed Lesson with recorded attendance.
end note
@enduml
